+    /// just never replies, `next()` times out, and the connection carries on in the clear.
+    ///
+    /// The message proves ownership of the address the peer already knows as this server's public
+    /// key, by signing our ephemeral X25519 public key with our Ed25519 signing key, and carries
+    /// the sealed symmetric key, matching rustdesk `src/common.rs` `key_exchange`.
